======== 5. Monopole 'plasma' frequency (collective long-range effects, cf. Lasenby 2007.00667) ========
local 0.4 GeV/cm3: omega_p = 1.84e-09 s^-1, 1/omega_p = 1.72e+01 yr
cluster ~1e-2 GeV/cm3: omega_p = 2.91e-10 s^-1, 1/omega_p = 1.09e+02 yr
cosmic mean: omega_p = 3.28e-12 s^-1, 1/omega_p = 9.67e+03 yr

======== 6. Higgs portal (allowed by all stated symmetries) ========
v=8.09e+11: lambda_p v^2 <= m_h^2 (125 GeV)^2 needs lambda_p <= 2.4e-20
v=1.45e+12: lambda_p v^2 <= m_h^2 (125 GeV)^2 needs lambda_p <= 7.5e-21
portal equilibrates sectors at T=1e+12 if lambda_p >~ 5.3e-02

======== 7. psi annihilation epoch vs BBN (hidden x_f ~ 20-25, T_h/T from entropy, xi0=0.76) ========
m_psi=1 MeV: hidden freeze-out T_h ~ m/20 = 0.05 MeV at T_vis ~ 0.0806 MeV (BBN D-formation ~0.07 MeV; n/p freeze-out ~0.8 MeV)
m_psi=3 MeV: hidden freeze-out T_h ~ m/20 = 0.15 MeV at T_vis ~ 0.242 MeV (BBN D-formation ~0.07 MeV; n/p freeze-out ~0.8 MeV)
m_psi=10 MeV: hidden freeze-out T_h ~ m/20 = 0.5 MeV at T_vis ~ 0.707 MeV (BBN D-formation ~0.07 MeV; n/p freeze-out ~0.8 MeV)
m_psi=30 MeV: hidden freeze-out T_h ~ m/20 = 1.5 MeV at T_vis ~ 2.12 MeV (BBN D-formation ~0.07 MeV; n/p freeze-out ~0.8 MeV)
